          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A hand crank radio is worth owning for its weather alert, its radio and its light. Buy one with an automatic NOAA alert and a disposable-battery backup, and the Midland ER310 is the one we would put in a household kit first.
          </p>
